<%#
  The Royal Knot logo: the knot mark (inline SVG) and the wordmark as real
  text, so it stays crisp, follows the site typography and is read by screen
  readers. Options (all optional):
    tone   'on-dark' (gold mark, ivory name) | 'on-light' (antique-gold mark,
           burgundy name) | 'mono' (one colour: currentColor)
    href   makes the logo a link
    label  accessible name for the link (default "The Royal Knot — home")
    sub    a small line under the name, e.g. "Planning studio"
    cls    extra classes for layout in the host header
%>
<% const tone = locals.tone || 'on-dark'; const tag = locals.href ? 'a' : 'span'; %>
<<%= tag %> class="rk-logo rk-logo--<%= tone %> <%= locals.cls || '' %>"<% if (locals.href) { %> href="<%= locals.href %>" aria-label="<%= locals.label || 'The Royal Knot — home' %>"<% } %>>
  <svg class="rk-mark" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M25 55 V38.6 M25 32.6 V13 C25 10.8 26.8 9 29 9 H36.5 C43 9 47.5 13.4 47.5 19.4 C47.5 24.1 44.6 27.3 40.4 29.1 L19 38.1 C15.6 39.5 15.6 42.4 19 43.9 L22.2 45.34 M27.8 47.87 L45.8 56"/></svg>
  <span class="rk-wordmark">The Royal Knot<% if (locals.sub) { %><small><%= locals.sub %></small><% } %></span>
</<%= tag %>>
